usage: hypotrail decide [-h] --study DIR --question TEXT --option TEXT
                        --author {human,proxy} [--source TEXT] --artifact ID
                        --request-id ID --read-sequence N [--question-id ID]
                        [--option-id ID] [--words-file FILE] [--words TEXT]
                        [--channel {panel,choice,chat_relayed}] [--by LABEL]
                        [--json]
INVALID_ARGUMENTS [config]: the following arguments are required: --question, --option, --author, --artifact, --request-id, --read-sequence
